 "toc": [],
 "hast": "\n<p>This project and the components are written in TypeScript. <strong>We recommend using TypeScript for your project as well</strong>.</p>\n<p>However we provide a JavaScript version of the components, available via the <a href=\"/docs/cli\">cli</a>.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"txt\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"Would you like to use TypeScript (recommended)? no\" data-language=\"txt\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Would you like to use TypeScript (recommended)? no</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>To opt-out of TypeScript, you can use the <code>tsx</code> flag in your <code>components.json</code> file.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">components.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;style&#x22;: &#x22;default&#x22;,\n  &#x22;tailwind&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;config&#x22;: &#x22;tailwind.config.js&#x22;,\n    &#x22;css&#x22;: &#x22;src/app/globals.css&#x22;,\n    &#x22;baseColor&#x22;: &#x22;zinc&#x22;,\n    &#x22;cssVariables&#x22;: true\n  },\n  &#x22;rsc&#x22;: false,\n  &#x22;tsx&#x22;: false,\n  &#x22;aliases&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;utils&#x22;: &#x22;~/lib/utils&#x22;,\n    &#x22;components&#x22;: &#x22;~/components&#x22;\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"2\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"style\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"tailwind\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"config\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"tailwind.config.js\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"css\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"src/app/globals.css\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"baseColor\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"zinc\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"cssVariables\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">true</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  },</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"rsc\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">false</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"tsx\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#0550AE\">false</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"aliases\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"utils\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"~/lib/utils\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"components\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"~/components\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>To configure import aliases, you can use the following <code>jsconfig.json</code>:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><figcaption data-rehype-pretty-code-title=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\">jsconfig.json</figcaption><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"{\n  &#x22;compilerOptions&#x22;: {\n    &#x22;paths&#x22;: {\n      &#x22;@/*&#x22;: [&#x22;./*&#x22;]\n    }\n  }\n}\" data-line-numbers=\"\" data-language=\"json\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\" data-line-numbers-max-digits=\"1\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">{</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">    \"paths\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\" data-highlighted-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">      \"@/*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">: [</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"./*\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>"
